+# Level‑4 Flip & Runbook (Executive playbook)
+
+Prereqs:
+- Detector images deployed cluster-wide and smoke-verified.
+- DP service multi-AZ healthy; dp_service health check passing.
+- OPA loaded with level4_policy.rego and tested in staging.
+- Orchestrator v2 deployed and connected to Argo.
