+Emergency rollback:
+- kubectl -n aegis-system set env deployment/aegis-orchestrator AUTONOMY_MODE=conservative
+- kubectl -n aegis-ml scale deployment model-serving --replicas=<previous>
+- Open incident and perform RCA.
+
+Sign-off:
